Package: MarkUsRStudioAddin
Title: Submit RStudio Files to MarkUs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tianshu", "Luan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tianshu.luan@utoronto.ca")
Description: Provides an RStudio addin for submitting files to MarkUs.
    Uses a local identity broker to authenticate RStudio users without
    requiring students to enter MarkUs credentials or API keys.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
